    "text": "Hackathon Travel Micro-Grant – OHI/O\n\nHackathon Travel Micro-Grant Cal King 2026-05-20T15:42:47-04:00\n\n## Hackathon Travel Micro Grant\n\nThe OHI/O Hackathon Travel Micro Grant helps students go beyond local events by supporting participation in top hackathons across the country! The grant can cover travel, lodging, and other related expenses, making it easier to take part in high-impact opportunities. Explore past recipients and see how the grant helped them expand their skills, networks, and experiences.\n\n←\n\n→\n\n\"*\" indicates required fields\n\nInstagram\n\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\n\nSubscribe to our newsletter!*\n\nΔ\n\nTerms & Conditions | Privacy Policy | ©2025\n\n\"*\" indicates required fields\n\nInstagram\n\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\n\nSubscribe to our newsletter!*\n\nΔ\n\nTerms & Conditions | Privacy Policy | ©2024"
