    "title": "Global Student Startup Competition",
    "text": "Global Student Startup Competition\n\n### FOR STUDENTS\n\nTurn your ideas into global impact! Join global student change-makers from leading universities, pitch your start-ups, gain invaluable experiences, and lead the next generation of innovation. Explore more information on opportunities and benefits below.\n\n## BENEFITS:\n\n## 1. GLOBAL NETWORKING\n\nConnect with ambitious students, mentors, and innovators from some of the world’s leading universities. An amazing opportunity for meaningful relationships that extend beyond the competition and into your future!\n\n## 2. STARTUP EXPERIENCE\n\nDevelop and pitch a real business idea. Through GSSC, students will foster skill sets preparing them for their future endeavors. This competition is about allowing students to lead change in solving real-world, critical human-centered problems of our time.\n\n## 3. EXCLUSIVE OPPORTUNITIES\n\nGain direct exposure to top entrepreneurs, investors, and mentors across diverse industries through GSSC x ALC Conference. Students will be working side-by-side with experts and peers from innovative, ambitious universities around the globe to refine their ideas into impactful ventures.\n\n## 4. CROSS-CULTURAL COLLABORATION\n\nJoin 100+ student entrepreneurs from top universities, including USC, Harvard, Aalto, in Latin America, and more!\n\n## 4. SPONSORED TRIP\n\nTeams will receive travel and lodging support to attend the GSSC Worlds Finals in Seoul, South Korea. Sponsorship details to be confirmed soon!\n\n## OPPORTUNITES\n"
